v> </div> </div>You can already transition between styles in 3e pretty damn easily. It's baked in!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-17T17:11:29-08:00","id":832196,"title":"","content":"I would surprised if the Dragon Styles got <i>no</i> Mastery effects, given that &quot;mortal Immaculate&quot; is a super common Solar backstory (like, it shows up twice in the Castebooks - rivaled only by &quot;assassin,&quot; and &quot;pirate&quot;). Likewise, I am not expecting DBs to get access to those effects - the Immaculates get Celestial-level stuff (probably), that's plenty.<br /> <br /> But that's still a suite of cool combat powers stronger than when other Terrestrials of comparable Essence are capable of. I don't see a problem there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For me, there's no fundamental conflict between really loving something and also seeing it as very profoundly flawed.&quot; -- Jay Eddidin","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2168-chejop-kejak","name":"Chejop Kejak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2168_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-17T17:27:23-08:00","id":832203,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crumplepunch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/831460-\u200ball-aboard-the-dragon-blooded-hype-train?p=831672#post831672\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Aside from that, I really hope there will be more support for non-Dynast Dragon-Bloods. DBs have the potential to be the most diverse splat aside from Solars and Exigents, and pigeonholing them only as aristocratic jerks is a waste of their potential.</div> </div> </div> </div>Lookshy4Life.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-17T17:37:14-08:00","id":832208,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/831460-\u200ball-aboard-the-dragon-blooded-hype-train?p=832203#post832203\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Lookshy4Life.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Lookshy! *Seventh Legion Gang Signs* More than a Twilight Training Program! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-17T19:17:30-08:00","id":832251,"title":"","content":"Hmm, what do I want from the &quot;Mid-Bosses&quot; of the Exalted universe? Well we're already getting a Realm book shortly after the DB book. So I'd definitely like to see some info on Lookshy. I'd also like to see an expanded view of the Lost Eggs/Outcastes. In places like the 100 Kingdoms, it would be interesting to see 2 dozen Lost Eggs come together and build a little nation for themselves.<br /> <br /> I'd also really like to see more on the Elemental Dragons themselves. Even just a few pages on what they've been up to since the Usurpation and the rise of the Realm. They can't be very happy about the loss of around 1/3 of Creation to the Wyld. Do they have any plans to take back parts of Creation from the Wyld? They've always been a part of Exalted, but they've never actually done anything even remotely interesting. I'd just like them to have a bit more personality. As it stood in 2E, they may as well have not even existed except, for when the Ebon Dragon was killing one of them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2103-talosx","name":"TalosX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"588"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-17T19:40:23-08:00","id":832273,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/831460-\u200ball-aboard-the-dragon-blooded-hype-train?p=832208#post832208\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Lookshy! *Seventh Legion Gang Signs* More than a Twilight Training Program! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>*Returns* Twilight Caste, citizen of Gens Amilar, large family of Terrestrials he still loves.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-17T19:44:59-08:00","id":832274,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/831460-\u200ball-aboard-the-dragon-blooded-hype-train?p=832273#post832273\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> *Returns* Twilight Caste, citizen of Gens Amilar, large family of Terrestrials he still loves.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;My family thinks that a demon-sorcerer ate my soul and started driving me around like a suit.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;That's rough, buddy.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-17T19:56:21-08:00","id":832283,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/831460-\u200ball-aboard-the-dragon-blooded-hype-train?p=832273#post832273\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> *Returns* Twilight Caste, citizen of Gens Amilar, large family of Terrestrials he still loves.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm a Twilight from the hood. No Gens, born a Helot.<br /> <br /> Dragonblooded are cool. My oldest brother is a Water Aspect. Took finding about my Exaltation really well too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 02-17-2016, 10:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-17T20:44:50-08:00","id":832301,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eric Minton</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/831460-\u200ball-aboard-the-dragon-blooded-hype-train?p=832172#post832172\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">We'd want to avoid a situation in which all Immaculates study those five styles... except for every single Immaculate PC, all of whom find an excuse to use something else.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sorry I parsed your post completely wrong. I read it as &quot;we don't want immaculate to study exclusively those styles, because it makes it weird when players choose different styles (which presumably they do very often.&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-17T22:14:26-08:00","id":832327,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/831460-\u200ball-aboard-the-dragon-blooded-hype-train?p=832274#post832274\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> &quot;My family thinks that a demon-sorcerer ate my soul and started driving me around like a suit.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;That's rough, buddy.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;My girlfriend turned into the moon&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh shut up! Its Exalted. EVERYONE'S slept with Lunar at least once in their lifetime.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Support new ideas. If you must criticize, always offer advice to the creator on how they could improve, or even suggest alternative solutions to fix a problem you can see. Dismissive comments should be equally dismissed as attempts to grab attention. Focus only on contributions that help you grow and develop, and ignore jealous efforts to stunt your creative sparks.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5915-zenvious","name":"zenvious","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-17T22:37:35-08:00","id":832330,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chejop Kejak</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/831460-\u200ball-aboard-the-dragon-blooded-hype-train?p=832196#post832196\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would surprised if the Dragon Styles got <i>no</i> Mastery effects, given that &quot;mortal Immaculate&quot; is a super common Solar backstory (like, it shows up twice in the Castebooks - rivaled only by &quot;assassin,&quot; and &quot;pirate&quot;). Likewise, I am not expecting DBs to get access to those effects - the Immaculates get Celestial-level stuff (probably), that's plenty.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd be in strong agreement of the Dragon styles lacking Mastery due to their design being for elemental users (and not Celestial Forces). I could still see them have the &quot;Terrestrial&quot; effect, but possibly with an elemental attachment to encourage certain degrees of 'Mastery' within styles (i.e.: an Earth Aspect can learn a Fire-focused Dragon Style, but will be restricted by the &quot;Terrestrial: Fire Aspect&quot; tags. However a Fire Exalt will likely have full access to the full power of their technique).<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Support new ideas. If you must criticize, always offer advice to the creator on how they could improve, or even suggest alternative solutions to fix a problem you can see. Dismissive comments should be equally dismissed as attempts to grab attention. Focus only on contributions that help you grow and develop, and ignore jealous efforts to stunt your creative sparks.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5915-zenvious","name":"zenvious","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T00:31:54-08:00","id":832374,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Unsung Hero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/831460-\u200ball-aboard-the-dragon-blooded-hype-train?p=832192#post832192\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You can already transition between styles in 3e pretty damn easily. It's baked in!</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean that It would be cool if the conditions for reflexively entering each Style's Form were particularly easy to fulfill coming if you are changing around the Dragon Styles.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/868-danelsan","name":"danelsan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar868_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T05:33:05-08:00","id":832455,"title":"","content":"Did I miss something? Was the db book announced?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","name":"Gonzo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar90_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"934"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T06:24:30-08:00","id":832469,"title":"","content":"It's in the process of being written, if that counts as &quot;announced&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T06:25:06-08:00","id":832470,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>zenvious</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/831460-\u200ball-aboard-the-dragon-blooded-hype-train?p=832330#post832330\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd be in strong agreement of the Dragon styles lacking Mastery due to their design being for elemental users (and not Celestial Forces). I could still see them have the &quot;Terrestrial&quot; effect, but possibly with an elemental attachment to encourage certain degrees of 'Mastery' within styles (i.e.: an Earth Aspect can learn a Fire-focused Dragon Style, but will be restricted by the &quot;Terrestrial: Fire Aspect&quot; tags. However a Fire Exalt will likely have full access to the full power of their technique).</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't think that's how inventing MA Styles works in-setting. I don't think Terrestrial and Mastery keywords are in-setting concepts one can design around, rather than natural consequences of the same moves being employed by less- and more-skilled users, respectively.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/582-morangias","name":"Morangias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar582_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1670"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T06:52:25-08:00","id":832487,"title":"","content":"In setting the Immaculate Martial Arts were supposed to have been designed specifically for Dragonblooded use, though, by Sidereals. They're not just martial arts which were developed for mortal use, and without the sifu thinking about how they interact with Dragonblooded essence, and it happens the Dragonblooded can Exaltify them. <br /> <br /> So with that in mind, I don't think it wouldn't make sense for them to lack Mastery effects (as distinct from being a good idea) - it could be that they just don't have that potential due to how they've been shaped, as they're just too oriented to being fully realized by Dragonblooded (as opposed to &quot;Aha! With full knowledge of the idea of Mastery effects, we're going to design this to lack Mastery power just in case a Solar gets his hands on them!&quot;).<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lanaya</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/831460-\u200ball-aboard-the-dragon-blooded-hype-train?p=832159#post832159\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd assume their reason for using them will be that the Dragon styles are going to be <i>awesome</i>. They don't need extra special benefits on top of that. And from a setting perspective they'll favour Dragon styles over all the other awesome MAs because of the religious and cultural significance of those styles and the fact that all of the Immaculate sifus know and therefore teach the Dragon styles.</div> </div> </div> </div>Although that *could* work OK, it did feel cool for the Immaculate MA to have those Dragonblooded only bonuses in First and Second Edition, to represent that these are designed for Dragonblooded and that they are the natural masters of those styles. It feels cool for them to have ways of using those styles no-one can touch and would be cool for those to come back.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/929-ghosthead","name":"Ghosthead","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T07:56:19-08:00","id":832523,"title":"","content":"Remember that for 3rd edition, all Martial Arts are just that. A series of techniques and philosophies that are honed into a combat style. Anyone can learn them, even Joe Shmoe the farmer. They aren't restricted with being &quot;chosen&quot; or &quot;special&quot; or &quot;exalted&quot; or anything. Anyone can learn a Martial Art with enough practice and determination.<br /> <br /> When one IS exalted, their Essence flows through them and enhances all of their natural skills. This includes techniques and philosophies learned in a Martial Art. The degree to which your Essence can enhance your skills is based on the nature of your Essence (Dragonblood, Lunar, Liminal, Solar, blah blah). This is where the Terrestrial and Mastery tags come in. It's not a design philosophy in the Martial Art, it's the nature and extent to which your personal Essence expresses itself through the techniques and philosophies of the Martial Art you learned.<br /> <br /> Terrestrials supposedly will have the ability with enough training and meditation to expand beyond the limitations of their Essence nature and evolve beyond the Terrestrial keyword. This is a big deal for them! And it's cool that it's in there!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T08:47:54-08:00","id":832541,"title":"","content":"I don't SMA will buy into the idea that Joe Shmoe farmer is picking them up...<br /> <br /> Seriously, personally, I would bet that the idea that the concept that the Sidereals designed the Dragon Styles with the Dragonblooded in mind, and with an understanding of how these arts would be unlocked by Dragonblooded essence isn't going to go anywhere (together with bonuses for Dragonblooded and possibly challenges and lesser returns for non-Dragonblooded stylists). Mortals can learn them, yes, Solars can learn them, yes, but their ability to use essence (as low or high as that may be) may not speak with them the same way. I think the Sidereals are perfectly capable of designing a martial art which mortals can use, with the knowledge and design that when an Exalt learns it, and applies his knowledge and power to it, he'll get different results depending on whether he's aspected towards it.<br /> <br /> We'll have to wait and see, of course, there's just no way I can read the Immaculate Martial Arts chapter in Exalted 1e Dragonblooded, which the authors will have read too, and come away with the a different impression.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/929-ghosthead","name":"Ghosthead","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T09:18:11-08:00","id":832553,"title":"","content":"Actually, as crazy as this sounds, with all the new directions 3rd edition is taking I would really love to see that the Dragonblooded THEMSELVES invented the 5 Dragon Styles. Once they forge the Shogunate and/or the Realm and start seeing themselves as the rulers the world needs, they focus inwardly and develop these amazing martial arts styles that reflect their own strengths and prowess.<br /> <br /> There's nothing wrong with the previous idea that the Sidereals developed it for them, but what if the most they did was give someone inspiration, and in the end an amazing Dragonblooded master developed the 5 styles themselves and propagated it through the Realm? That would be really cool and would give the dragon host something to brag about in the world... something they have accomplished beyond just Big Red.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T11:53:04-08:00","id":832634,"title":"","content":"I have one thing on this I absolutely want to see gone. <br /> <br /> &quot;You have a mighty powerful charm, but it automatically fails against celestials.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1777-kell_tamer","name":"Kell_Tamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1777_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"389"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T12:50:02-08:00","id":832685,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kell_Tamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/831460-\u200ball-aboard-the-dragon-blooded-hype-train?p=832634#post832634\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have one thing on this I absolutely want to see gone.<br /> <br /> &quot;You have a mighty powerful charm, but it automatically fails against celestials.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>We <b>know</b> that 