ggkDvjTeXmzFsGHKRxAi6L_Ry6g4w/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">A Wyld Behemoth</a></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8838-tds","name":"TDS","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"275"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T13:27:46-08:00","id":832717,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TDS</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/831460-\u200ball-aboard-the-dragon-blooded-hype-train?p=832701#post832701\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Or even worse, &quot;Fails against stunts&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>Poor Fair Folk.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T13:29:15-08:00","id":832719,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TDS</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/831460-\u200ball-aboard-the-dragon-blooded-hype-train?p=832701#post832701\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Or even worse, &quot;Fails against stunts&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I hated that sort of thing.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1777-kell_tamer","name":"Kell_Tamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1777_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"389"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T22:13:46-08:00","id":833037,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/831460-\u200ball-aboard-the-dragon-blooded-hype-train?p=832469#post832469\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's in the process of being written, if that counts as &amp;quot;announced&amp;quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>Any sneak peeks? Anything? Writer comments?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","name":"Gonzo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar90_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"934"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T23:12:39-08:00","id":833063,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gonzo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/831460-\u200ball-aboard-the-dragon-blooded-hype-train?p=833037#post833037\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Any sneak peeks? Anything? Writer comments?</div> </div> </div> </div>There was the backer DB preview, but that's years old now and some of the stuff from it has been confirmed to have changed. Honestly I'm not sure why start the Hype Train so early, I can't imagine DBs are going to come out in 2016. The corebook still needs to be indexed before we even start worrying about the book that's two books BEFORE Dragonblooded.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T23:30:54-08:00","id":833072,"title":"","content":"I think John mentioned a few things about the Houses, they want to make them more different from each other, and their choice a more significant part of your character. They're changing the way a lot of them are run. Cynis is being made more into a House that trades in secrets, with its brothels a way to do that, rather than just being all about the decadence.<br /> I don't remember much else.<br /> <br /> Oh, they're changing the way out-of-aspect stuff works, I remember that. But they didn't say how.<br /> <br /> It was all pretty vague (as I guess it's still in progress).<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T23:54:28-08:00","id":833078,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/831460-\u200ball-aboard-the-dragon-blooded-hype-train?p=833072#post833072\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think John mentioned a few things about the Houses, they want to make them more different from each other, and their choice a more significant part of your character. They're changing the way a lot of them are run. Cynis is being made more into a House that trades in secrets, with its brothels a way to do that, rather than just being all about the decadence.<br /> I don't remember much else.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think one of the changes was that Sesus is now really closely aligned with Cynis and acts as their muscle?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-19T01:16:10-08:00","id":833108,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Unsung Hero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/831460-\u200ball-aboard-the-dragon-blooded-hype-train?p=832553#post832553\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Actually, as crazy as this sounds, with all the new directions 3rd edition is taking I would really love to see that the Dragonblooded THEMSELVES invented the 5 Dragon Styles. Once they forge the Shogunate and/or the Realm and start seeing themselves as the rulers the world needs, they focus inwardly and develop these amazing martial arts styles that reflect their own strengths and prowess.<br /> <br /> There's nothing wrong with the previous idea that the Sidereals developed it for them, but what if the most they did was give someone inspiration, and in the end an amazing Dragonblooded master developed the 5 styles themselves and propagated it through the Realm? That would be really cool and would give the dragon host something to brag about in the world... something they have accomplished beyond just Big Red.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not crazy. I'll give that there's a kind of awesome from Dragonblooded inventing them themselves; there's also a kind from having heavenly sages creating them for Dragonblooded as the last hope to ward the world from dangerous spirits (and it gives the Sidereals an achievement to *their* name as peerless martial artists in Creation).<br /> <br /> Generally I'm more into the setting expanding achievements for Immaculate Order in new directions than swapping around achievements previously established. As well, anyway I'd see the real business of creating the Immaculate MA as more a collaborative partnership between outstanding Dragonblooded students and great Sidereal sifus, even where the Sidereals are involved.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/929-ghosthead","name":"Ghosthead","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-19T05:04:30-08:00","id":833166,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/831460-\u200ball-aboard-the-dragon-blooded-hype-train?p=833078#post833078\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think one of the changes was that Sesus is now really closely aligned with Cynis and acts as their muscle?</div> </div> </div> </div>That's not a massive change, they were already heavily-aligned with Cynis (and Mnemon, though they were a bit worried about that) in 2nd ed. One of their households had more Wood than Fire aspects because they married into Cynis so often.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-19T05:56:23-08:00","id":833194,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eric Minton</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/831460-\u200ball-aboard-the-dragon-blooded-hype-train?p=832154#post832154\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sidereals vs. Neil Gaiman in an all-out celestial cage match to the death! Taking all bets!</div> </div> </div> </div>Neils &quot;Spontaneous cage and crowd prana&quot; needs some serious balance.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm making the Tales of Exalts webcomic<br /> <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/50854781/tales-of-exalts\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...ales-of-exalts</a><br /> alchemical report <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/54812164/Alchemical-Report\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...hemical-Report</a><br /> the fall <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4455-xanroth","name":"Xanroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4455_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1072"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-19T06:56:15-08:00","id":833221,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crumplepunch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/831460-\u200ball-aboard-the-dragon-blooded-hype-train?p=831672#post831672\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Aside from that, I really hope there will be more support for non-Dynast Dragon-Bloods. DBs have the potential to be the most diverse splat aside from Solars and Exigents, and pigeonholing them only as aristocratic jerks is a waste of their potential.</div> </div> </div> </div>Personally, I think the problem with playable Outcastes the last two editions is that their character creation was geared heavily towards being a peasant of unremarkable ancestry* who started glowing one day and that execution left them too far removed from standard DB story hooks to warrant more guidelines than &quot;you can play Dragon-Blooded like Solars&quot;.<br /> <br /> *I draw particular attention to the Outcaste version of the Breeding background which didn't seem to understand than an Outcaste being the bastard child of a Dynastic Dragon-Blooded was pretty probable all things considered.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-19T08:14:48-08:00","id":833283,"title":"","content":"Also, while being an outcaste from a family of outcastes is unlikely, it's certainly plausible. The Shogunate did not cover almost all of Creation, and a lot of monarchs probably trace their lineage back to a Daimyo.<br /> And of course, go to a great deal of hassle to try to find more Dragonblood to marry into their families.<br /> <br /> There are several kingdoms the PCs have come across in my game ruled by small groups of Dragonblood, who are constantly scheming (in different ways depending on their various cultures) to try to find ways to reinvigorate their blood. as it seemed to me this is something that would be common.<br /> I'd guess a very high portion of Dragonblood Outcastes rule petty kingdoms in the Threshold.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-19T08:32:06-08:00","id":833301,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/831460-\u200ball-aboard-the-dragon-blooded-hype-train?p=833283#post833283\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, while being an outcaste from a family of outcastes is unlikely, it's certainly plausible.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes. As I've pointed out on previous occasions this has come up, possessing a 5-dot artifact is extremely rare but you don't get punished for being a statistical outlier there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-19T18:20:44-08:00","id":833625,"title":"","content":"Indeed, the same could apply for Cult 5, Followers 5, etc.<br /> <br /> Still, could be worse. In 2nd ed Lunars had to pay double for several backgrounds (followers, influence, I think Cult) when honestly Lunars are more likely to have that than Solars because they might have been around for more than 5 years, have other Lunars to help them, live in a Threshold state where people worship Lunars, etc.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-19T18:52:33-08:00","id":833642,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/831460-\u200ball-aboard-the-dragon-blooded-hype-train?p=833625#post833625\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Indeed, the same could apply for Cult 5, Followers 5, etc.<br /> <br /> Still, could be worse. In 2nd ed Lunars had to pay double for several backgrounds (followers, influence, I think Cult) when honestly Lunars are more likely to have that than Solars because they might have been around for more than 5 years, have other Lunars to help them, live in a Threshold state where people worship Lunars, etc.</div> </div> </div> </div>Even worse, they couldn't have animals as familiars if the animal in question was typically prey of their spirit shape.<br /> <br /> (Technically, it was double for dots four and five, not double everything.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-20T03:31:29-08:00","id":833769,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/831460-\u200ball-aboard-the-dragon-blooded-hype-train?p=833625#post833625\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Indeed, the same could apply for Cult 5, Followers 5, etc.<br /> <br /> Still, could be worse. In 2nd ed Lunars had to pay double for several backgrounds (followers, influence, I think Cult) when honestly Lunars are more likely to have that than Solars because they might have been around for more than 5 years, have other Lunars to help them, live in a Threshold state where people worship Lunars, etc.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> It was followers, backing and influence, and as Saur Ops mention it was the 4th and 5th dot that was more expensive.<br /> Cult, Lunars could start with a maximum of 3* through which might be what you thought off.<br /> *as opposed to the cap of 2 Solars were allowed, In fact there where a lot of limitations on starting with Cult, so that might not be the best example for comparision.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/613-vegetalss4","name":"Vegetalss4","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar613_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"94"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-20T20:38:01-08:00","id":834230,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gonzo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/831460-\u200ball-aboard-the-dragon-blooded-hype-train?p=833037#post833037\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Any sneak peeks? Anything? Writer comments?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, there's [Lucy is crash-tackled off the forums by John and Holden] [muffled yelling] CYNIS AND [crashing noises] LET ME TELL THEM ABOUT [glass breaking].<br /> <br /> (In all seriousness, Vance is periodically teasing where's he's up to on Charms over twitter, John and Holden are red-lining + all the other Dev stuff like checking text and Backer Charms and outlines for other stuff and [REDACTED] and the Quickstart Guide I think? and, you know, making a living and getting sick and coughing a lung up over Skype, and dealing with certain obnoxious writers* who insist on being neurotic wrecks at them).<br /> <br /> (I can't wait til I can talk more about it because it was such a fascinating project to work on, and there are some bits that I LOVE SO DAMN MUCH)<br /> <br /> *me, the certain obnoxious writer is me...<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<span style=\"color:#5C5C5C\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">. ... for me, the transformative power of art is you are </span></span></span><i>not </i><span style=\"color:#5C5C5C\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">above the material.&quot; -= Guillermo del Toro</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":13}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9752-lucy-darling","name":"Lucy Darling","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9752_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"143"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-20T21:42:27-08:00","id":834255,"title":"","content":"Don't kid yourself, Lucy\u2014we're <i>all</i> neurotic wrecks at them. Comes with the territory.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted.<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1120-eric-minton","name":"Eric Minton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1120_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2000"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-20T21:44:47-08:00","id":834257,"title":"","content":"Being a neurotic wreck is the sign of a great artist.<br /> <br /> Can you at least tell us which parts you wrote? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}